2026-10-06T21:01:33.3068755Z       <h1>Contact support</h1>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3069124Z       <p class=\"reviewed\">Last reviewed 2026-10-05</p>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3070421Z       <p class=\"intro\">Write to Bradleyapple1031@gmail.com. Email is the canonical transport. Read What support covers first — the fastest support reply is the one that fits a request we can actually answer.</p>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3071550Z       <section>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3071837Z         <h2>What to include</h2>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3072130Z         <ul>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3073083Z           <li>Account email. The address on your coach account. If you signed in with Apple hidden-relay address, send the relay address — it is what we look up by.</li>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3074539Z           <li>What you were trying to do. One sentence. &quot;Send my first invite&quot;, &quot;open the billing portal&quot;, &quot;see a client thread&quot;.</li>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3075563Z           <li>What actually happened. One or two sentences. Include the exact error text if there was one.</li>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3076468Z           <li>When it happened. Approximate time and timezone is fine. We use it to find the request in the logs.</li>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3077358Z           <li>Screenshots, if a UI is involved. Crop to the relevant region; we do not need the whole desktop.</li>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3078408Z           <li>A client account email, if the issue involves them. Only share an email; do not share their password, payment details, or health information.</li>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3079133Z         </ul>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3079376Z       </section>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3079602Z       <section>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3079881Z         <h2>Intake schema</h2>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3081368Z         <p>For operators or vendors building a contact form against this inbox in the future, the canonical intake fields are listed below. There is no separate API endpoint today; email is the transport.</p>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3082522Z         <table class=\"intake\">
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3082824Z           <thead>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3083265Z             <tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Required</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3083821Z           </thead>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3084076Z           <tbody>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3084611Z           <tr><td>account_email</td><td>email</td><td>yes</td><td>Coach account email or Apple relay address.</td></tr>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3085570Z           <tr><td>category</td><td>enum</td><td>yes</td><td>One of: outage, billing, client_signup, data, security, account_merge, other.</td></tr>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3086503Z           <tr><td>subject</td><td>string</td><td>yes</td><td>Free-form, up to 120 characters.</td></tr>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3087311Z           <tr><td>body</td><td>string</td><td>yes</td><td>Free-form. Plain text is fine; markdown is rendered.</td></tr>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3088202Z           <tr><td>client_email</td><td>email</td><td>no</td><td>Set only when the issue is about a specific client.</td></tr>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3089110Z           <tr><td>attachments</td><td>file[]</td><td>no</td><td>Up to 5 files, 10 MB each. Images, PDFs, plain text only.</td></tr>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3090000Z           <tr><td>console_url</td><td>string</td><td>no</td><td>The URL the coach was on when the issue happened.</td></tr>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3090917Z           <tr><td>user_agent</td><td>string</td><td>no</td><td>Auto-filled by the form, useful for browser-specific issues.</td></tr>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3092016Z           <tr><td>ts_iso</td><td>datetime</td><td>yes</td><td>ISO-8601 client timestamp, auto-filled.</td></tr>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3092546Z           </tbody>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3092774Z         </table>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3093018Z       </section>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3093252Z       <section>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3093679Z         <h2>What not to send</h2>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3094092Z         <p>A few items we will never need and cannot use:</p>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3094475Z         <ul>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3094863Z           <li>Passwords. We will never ask, and we cannot use them.</li>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3095429Z           <li>Card numbers. Card management lives in the Stripe portal.</li>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3096675Z           <li>Personal health information that the client did not consent to share with us. Coach-client conversations can stay between you and your client; support does not need them to investigate account or platform issues.</li>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3097701Z         </ul>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3097969Z       </section>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3098209Z       <section>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3098471Z         <h2>Response expectations</h2>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3099722Z         <p>See the SLAs on What support covers. If you have not heard back within the stated window, reply to your own thread — do not open a second one. Replies bump priority; new threads start from the back.</p>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3100655Z       </section>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3101433Z       <p class=\"footnote\">There is no chat or phone line. Email is the only support channel today; if and when a form or in-app channel is added, this page will say so.</p>
2026-10-06T21:01:33.3102255Z       <footer class=\"brand-footer\">
